# The Tide Engine - the quest "The Seventh Tide" played through (plan Relic of the Seventh Tide, the finale)
# The ring at 5 m, the well (the heart) at 2 m, r 13, its ramp from the south rim (0 -22..-10). Landing 0 -44, wheel
# hall 28.5 0 (sluice channel z -12 from x 36 east, at -3), crane hall 0 28.5 (the crane cab 0 38 at 11), piston
# hall -28.5 0, the ring's top -42 0 at 9.5. Kett's cage 8 -20 on the south rim. Beam: emitter -6.8 -6, mirrors -6 -2
# and 6 -2, the reactor panel 6 6.
island The Tide Engine
offset 0 0
expect title The Seventh Tide
walk 0 -54 to 0 -46 h=5
zone landing
read Kett's final camp log
kill Hyena
expect step 3
open Syndicate supply crate
expect story radiocodes 1
use radio
expect story taunt 1
expect step 6
walk 6 -38 to 20 -20 to 28.5 -6 to 28.5 0 h=5
zone wheel_hall
read Engine diagram
use sluicelever
expect message will not move
use wheel1
use wheel2
use wheel3
expect story wheelturn 3
expect spinsown wheel1
use sluicelever
expect hidden sluicegate
expect step 10
zone sluice_gallery
kill Stingray
open Sluice cache
expect item TitaniumIngot 2
expect step 13
walk 28.5 6 to 20 20 to 0 22 to 0 26 h=5
zone crane_hall
use claw
expect hidden armlow
expect shown armhigh
read The Seventh Tide tablet
use cabladder
expect height 11.2
zone arm_top
open Crane cab locker
expect story cagekey 1
zone heart_rim
open Kett's satchel
expect message cage key first
use kettcage
expect survivor seventhtide_kett
open Kett's satchel
read Kett's warning
expect step 20
walk 0 -22 to 0 -12 to 0 -6 h=2
zone heart
kill Polar bear
expect step 22
use seventhlever
expect message locked
beam emitter
use mirror1
wait 1
beam emitter
use mirror2
wait 2
beam emitter
expect story heartbeam 1
read Heart inscription
use seventhlever
expect hidden coreglow
expect shown coldlights
expect story enginestopped 1
expect step 25
open Engine treasury
expect story relic 1
walk -28.5 -6 to -28.5 0 to -36 0 to -42 0 h=9.5
zone ring_top
expect done
